{"text": " You wake up in 1747 aboard HMS Salisbury, a British warship on patrol. Did you know that the cure for sailors' worst disease was found this year, and the Navy waited almost 50 years to use it? Here's your plate, every day, a pound of hard biscuit and a gallon of beer. Salt, be for pork, dried peas, oatmeal, a little cheese, almost nothing fresh. After weeks at sea, men get scurvy, bleeding gums, old wounds opening up. The ship's surgeon, James Lynn, splits 12 sailors with scurvy into pairs and gives each pair something different. Cider, vinegar, and one pair gets two oranges in a lemon a day. So what is food now? Medicine, the right food can cure you. On land in Britain, a newborn could still expect fewer than 40 years. The Navy finally handed out lemon juice in 1795. A century later in Japan, another missing piece is making sailors sick.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 3.28, "text": " You wake up in 1747 aboard HMS Salisbury,", "tokens": [50364, 509, 6634, 493, 294, 3282, 14060, 27488, 389, 10288, 5996, 271, 22536, 11, 50540], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1902940625050029, "compression_ratio": 1.4850746268656716, "no_speech_prob": 0.02153424359858036, "words": [{"word": " You", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.12, "probability": 0.8243044018745422}, {"word": " wake", "start": 0.12, "end": 0.28, "probability": 0.987154483795166}, {"word": " up", "start": 0.28, "end": 0.44, "probability": 0.9990614056587219}, {"word": " in", "start": 0.44, "end": 0.58, "probability": 0.9930684566497803}, {"word": " 1747", "start": 0.58, "end": 1.78, "probability": 0.9864442944526672}, {"word": " aboard", "start": 1.78, "end": 2.16, "probability": 0.8751876354217529}, {"word": " HMS", "start": 2.16, "end": 2.66, "probability": 0.9841829240322113}, {"word": " Salisbury,", "start": 2.66, "end": 3.28, "probability": 0.8611853321393331}]}, {"id": 1, "seek": 0, "start": 3.62, "end": 4.92, "text": " a British warship on patrol.", "tokens": [50540, 257, 622